# Product name

This app is **Lociros**. Use that name in UI copy, docs, comments, logs, and conversation.

`levla` is the git/repo/folder name only. Do not call the product Levla or Grammario unless referring to those historical names.

# Hosting

Production is Vercel (Next.js) + Supabase (Postgres). FastAPI is a long-running Docker process. A Lightsail 4 GB instance is the AWS option that fits; do not add RDS, S3, ECS, or an ALB unless explicitly requested. Do not run FastAPI on Vercel.
